def get_slide_data() -> dict:
    return {
        'title': 'Phase 2: LHS Sampling → SPARTA → Flight Metrics → History DB',
        'content': '\n# Phase 2: Latin Hypercube Sampling Loop\n\nWith the baseline established, we now sweep the 4D design space using **jittered uniform sampling** (seed=42 for reproducibility).\n\n## Sample Generation Strategy\n\n```python\nnp.random.seed(42)\nfor i in range(samples_n):\n    val = p_info[\'min\'] + (p_info[\'max\'] - p_info[\'min\']) \\\n          * (i + np.random.random()) / samples_n\n```\n\nThis produces a **deterministic LHS-like stratified sampling** — each stratum `[i/N, (i+1)/N]` of the [0,1] unit interval gets exactly one sample, but with jitter for diversity.\n\n## Per-Sample Pipeline\n\nFor each sample $i$ from `start_idx` to `samples_n`:\n\n```\n1. HIAD_GeometryEngine.py  → HIAD_opt.surf / .step / .stl\n2. run_sparta_simulation() → Docker SPARTA DSMC\n3. parse_sparta_results()  → {drag, heat, shock_temp}\n4. calculate_flight_metrics() → {β, Kn, q̇_stag, g_load, T_surface, T_backface}\n5. history.add_sample()    → optimization_history.db\n6. Archive results         → results/<date>/<run_id>/sample_<i+1>/\n7. Accumulate training data → training_x, training_y\n```\n\n## Flight Metrics (`calculate_flight_metrics()`)\n\n| Metric | Formula | Significance |\n|---|---|---|\n| Ballistic Coefficient | $\\beta = mq / F_D$ | Deceleration profile |\n| Knudsen Number | $Kn = \\lambda / D$ | Rarefaction regime |\n| Peak Heat Flux | $\\dot{q}_{stag}$ [W/m²] | Thermal survival |\n| G-Load | $g = F_D / (m \\cdot 9.81)$ | Structural survival |\n| Surface Temp | $T_{surf} = (\\dot{q}/\\sigma\\epsilon)^{0.25}$ | Radiative equilibrium |\n| Backface Temp | $T_{back} = T_0 + \\dot{Q} \\cdot \\eta / (\\rho c_p t)$ | Electronics limit |\n\n## Checkpoint & Resume System\n\nAfter each sample, state is saved to `CADDesign/opt_checkpoint.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  "training_x": [...],\n  "training_y": [...],\n  "all_samples_dicts": [...],\n  "opt_params": {...},\n  "next_idx": i + 1,\n  "total_samples": N\n}\n```\n\nIf the run crashes, the next invocation **automatically resumes** from `next_idx`.\n\n## History Database (`optimization_history.db`)\n\nSQLite database with two tables:\n- `optimization_runs` — metadata per run (name, goal, status, best config)\n- `samples` — per-sample parameters, DSMC results, flight metrics, duration\n'
    }
